  "abstract": "Covers the OpenFeature specification v0.9.0: the evaluation API with provider mutator, domains and clients, typed and detailed flag evaluation, evaluation details, reasons and error codes, the dynamic-context and static-context paradigms, evaluation context with the targeting key and merge order, transaction context propagation, hooks with stages, ordering, hints and data, providers with resolution details, lifecycle, status and events, tracking, and the Appendix D telemetry mapping. Summarizes the OpenFeature Remote Evaluation Protocol at OpenAPI 0.4.0 (Draft posture: track). Records section statuses and CNCF Incubating status.",
